<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: 0, flexDirection: 'column', background: '#FFFFFF', overflow: 'hidden' }}>

    <Box style={{ height: 52, background: '#0E3F8C', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#FFFFFF', letterSpacing: 1 }}>高校实验室预约与设备运维系统</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#9FBCE8', letterSpacing: 1 }}>02　系统设计</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, paddingTop: 12 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', letterSpacing: 0.5 }}>系统架构：前后端分离的三层落地</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>52 个 Java 文件 · 2825 行　|　14 个 Vue 组件 · 4943 行</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 3, background: '#1E4FA8', marginTop: 8 }} />
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, paddingTop: 10, paddingBottom: 10 }}>

        <Box style={{ width: 1200, height: 378, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
            <Image src="assets/fig_arch.png" style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%', objectFit: 'contain' }} />
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', marginTop: 8 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>图 2　系统总体架构：表现层 → 接口层 → 业务层 → 数据层</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>8 个控制器 · 48 个 REST 接口 · 7 张表</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, marginTop: 10, height: 118 }}>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 3, height: 16, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>MyBatis-Plus</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 7 }}>
                    LambdaQueryWrapper 让时间区间条件可组合、字段名编译期校验，冲突查询不必拼字符串。
                </Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 3, height: 16, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>JWT + 拦截器 + 注解</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 7 }}>
                    只取 BCrypt 不引入整套 Spring Security，避免过滤器链与自定义拦截器重复，鉴权收敛一处。
                </Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 3, height: 16, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>统一响应与全局异常</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 7 }}>
                    统一返回体 code / msg / data 三层结构 + 全局异常处理，业务异常直接转提示，前端只判一个 code。
                </Text>
            </Box>

        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 44, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>计算机科学与技术学院 · 毕业设计答辩</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>07 / 14</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
